# A second question a token asks before it is anywhere: True-Name Nemesis's "As this creature enters, choose a player"
# (CR 614.12), put to Bot1 as Three Steps Ahead creates a token copy of the Nemesis. The same position as
# a-token-copy-of-painters-servant-hands-over-its-color-choice with a different kind of question, because what shows
# the asked seat the token is the engine and not the prompt. See ScriptedPositionsThroughTransportTests.
#
# Turn 1: a Black Lotus pays {1}{U}{U} for the Nemesis, which chooses Bot2; the second Lotus and the Island pay Three
# Steps Ahead's {U} and its copy mode's {3}. The handover is the second time the question is put.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
True-Name Nemesis
Three Steps Ahead
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.True-Name Nemesis.Cast
Bot1.ChoosePlayer(Bot2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Three Steps Ahead.Cast
Bot1.Modes(2)
Bot1.Target(True-Name Nemesis)
[Handover Bot1.ChoosePlayer]

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Step = Main1
Stack = Three Steps Ahead
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Mox Sapphire; True-Name Nemesis
